/*!
\page page_stctbtriggerdetector StCtbTriggerDetector

\brief CTB trigger detector data: MIP counts for 60 trays × 4 slats × 11 time samples.

\section stctbtriggerdetector_overview Overview
\c StCtbTriggerDetector stores data from the Central Trigger Barrel (CTB), a 240-slat
scintillator surrounding the TPC at midrapidity.  MIP counts are recorded for each of
60 trays, 4 slats per tray, and up to 11 bunch-crossing time samples to allow pile-up
rejection.  The CTB provides midrapidity multiplicity and topology inputs to the L0
trigger DSMs.

\section stctbtriggerdetector_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StCtbTriggerDetector
\endcode

\section stctbtriggerdetector_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Float_t[60][4][11] | mMips | MIP counts [tray][slat][time sample] |
| Float_t[32][11] | mAux | Auxiliary DSM words [word][time sample] |

\section stctbtriggerdetector_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `float mips(int tray, int slat, int evt=0) const` | MIP count for tray/slat/sample |
| `float mips(int evt=0) const` | Total MIP sum for sample evt |
| `float aux(int i, int evt=0) const` | Auxiliary word i at sample evt |
| `int numberOfTrays() const` | 60 |
| `int numberOfSlats() const` | 4 |

\section stctbtriggerdetector_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StCtbTriggerDetector& ctb = event->triggerDetectorCollection()->ctb();
cout << "CTB total MIPs: " << ctb.mips() << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_sttriggerdetectorcollection
\see \ref page_stmwctriggerdetector
*/
